   "text": "Under The Radar Tech Internship -\u00a0\n2026 Core Engineering Intern @ Etched\n\n\u00a0- Overview - Etched is a San Jose AI chip startup co-designing chips, racks, and software for frontier AI inference, backed by hundreds of millions from top-tier investors. Interns join the Core Engineering team, a special-projects group that builds internal tools and prototypes from 0 to 1, often in days.\n\u00a0- Requirements - Comfortable with Python and TypeScript, able to read, modify, debug, and direct AI tools to write code well. A track record of solving hard problems and something you have built that you can walk through in depth. Fully in-person at their San Jose office.\n\u00a0- Paid Internship - no comp provided in jo",
