  "7507541901114335232": {
   "created": 1789937472,
   "author": "Alec Coughlin",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/alecchh_ai-learns-what-your-organization-is-designed-activity-7507541901114335232-YA5B",
   "text": "AI learns what your organization is designed to teach it. Most are designed to teach it only what worked.\n\nTeaching an intelligent system what works is good.\nTeaching it what works and what hasn't is great.\n\nAt last week's Primary Venture Partners Summit, Etched co-founder + CEO Gavin Uberti described the job he hires 40-year veterans to do.\n\nSay don't do that. We tried it. Here's how it failed.\n\nNone of that is written down anywhere.\n\nRogo founder + CEO Gabriel Stengel put a number on it. \n\nRoughly 99% of the data in a private markets deal never gets written down.\n\nThat unwritten 99% is what builds intuition.\n\nYour veterans are holding the only copy.\n\nThe solve? A junior, veteran and an Int",
