  "7507808225178574848": {
   "created": 1790000969,
   "author": "Paul Healy",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/paulhealy862_in-his-2026-cio-symposium-keynote-jon-gray-activity-7507808225178574848-brvG",
   "text": "In his 2026 CIO Symposium keynote, Jon Gray highlighted the impact that Norm Ai has had on Blackstone's legal and compliance operations: 50% more efficient marketing document reviews, which directly accelerates the pace of fundraising and investor communications. The whole presentation (linked below) is worth watching for Blackstone's current thinking on macro trends relevant to AI.\n\nAs we've shared recently, Norm's long-term partnership with Blackstone has expanded significantly beyond compliance reviews. For instance, Norm Law has represented Blackstone on equity investments, such as BX's investment into Etched in August (press release below).",
