  "7507838633765367808": {
   "created": 1790008219,
   "author": "Venture Capital Journal",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/venture-capital-journal_venturecapital-artificialintelligence-venturecapitaljournal-activity-7507838633765367808-oegM",
   "text": "\ud83d\ude80 Bain Capital Ventures (BCV) has closed $1.6 billion for its 11th fund, exceeding its target. Read more here >>> https://okt.to/CKoAyc\n\nFund XI extends BCV's early-stage strategy across AI infrastructure, applications, physical AI, science, security and services. Its predecessor, which closed on $1.4 billion in January 2023, deployed more than 82 percent of capital into pre-seed through Series B rounds.\n\nRecent investments include AI inference hardware developer Etched, accounting software firm Rillet, and AI animation studio Osmo.\n\n#VentureCapital #ArtificialIntelligence #VentureCapitalJournal",
   "disc_score": 3,
