   "author": "Tavleen Gujral",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/activity-7507804902392446976-0su4",
   "text": "The most interesting question at AI Infra Summit: what does it take to turn impressive technology into a business customers can rely on?\n\nLast week\u2019s summit provided quite a few answers and perspectives. could not attend all but very enlightning sessions.\n\nIn \u201cThe Making of an AI-Era Semiconductor Company,\u201d Mitesh Agrawal, CEO of Positron AI, shared a telling example: performance benchmarking took days, while security and networking validation took months. For me, that captured how much adoption depends on fitting into a customer\u2019s existing environment.\n\n\u201cBuild a Winning AI Chip Startup from Scratch\u201d brought together Jonathan Pearce of AheadComputing, Robert W.of Etched, Andy Hock of Cerebra",
